  "goodToKnow": "Der Sammler (die Sammlerin) is a collector: ein Kunstsammler, ein Briefmarkensammler. Jäger und Sammler are hunter-gatherers. Germans love collecting: from Panini football stickers before every World Cup to Pfandflaschen (deposit bottles), which some people collect from bins to earn the deposit, called Flaschensammler. Die Sammlung is a collection, and der Sammlerwert is a collector's value. From sammeln, to collect."
